        <activityName xml:lang="en">Nitrobenzene, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Nitrobenzene, at plant
This inventory is based on literature that is based on actual plant throughputs and measurements. The air emissions (benzene) are taken from mid-ninties literature.;
CAS number: 000098-95-3; 
Formula: C6H5NO2; 
UUID: 63a2a6ee-ed84-3b5f-a47f-4650e0ff6e23
Included are the raw material, energy and auxillaries input togehter with air &amp; water emissions. Transports and infrastructure are estimated. No waste is taken into account.
Location: Average European Values
Technology: represents a current cross-section of actual plants in Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: see technology 
Extrapolations: see technology and generalComments
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_63a2a6ee-ed84-3b5f-a47f-4650e0ff6e23.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
